intro_lines = PackedStringArray("TICK: Morrow has been borrowing everyone's day.", "MORROW: A perfect schedule. The same day, forever.", "TICK: Your Echoes can break that cycle together.", "MORROW: Four stations. Two seconds. Surely impossible.", "TICK: Hold them with your plans. Claim the center yourself.", "Rook raises the watch. Somewhere, morning is waiting.")
